---
// 4.3.3 status 的四個值與轉移：誰改（AI＝生成流程的 mdx-writer、你＝手動改標記），以及工作台把它算成什麼。
// 2×2 擺法：上排 pending → generated，下排 failed、locked；箭頭在節點之間的格子裡，各自帶「誰」與「何時」。
// 太窄時在框內橫向捲動（狀態圖拆成一欄就讀不出轉移了）。
import Diagram from "../Diagram.astro";
---

<Diagram
  caption="標記的四種狀態與轉移：深藍箭頭是生成流程寫入的，墨線箭頭要你手動改標記。工作台把 generated 以外的三種都算成「待生成」。"
  scroll
  minWidth={600}
>
  <div>
    <ul class="dg-legend" aria-hidden="true">
      <li><span class="dg-who is-ai">AI</span>生成流程（mdx-writer）寫入</li>
      <li><span class="dg-who">你</span>手動改標記的 <code>status</code></li>
    </ul>
    <div class="sm">
      <div class="sm-entry dg-down"><span class="dg-lab sm-entry-lab"><span class="dg-who">你</span>寫新標記（省略 <code>status</code> 也算）</span></div>

      <div class="dg-node sm-state sm-pending">
        <code class="sm-name">pending</code>
        <span class="dg-d">還沒生成</span>
        <span class="sm-count">工作台：待生成</span>
      </div>
      <div class="sm-h">
        <span class="dg-lab"><span class="dg-who is-ai">AI</span>驗證通過，寫回筆記</span>
        <div class="dg-right dg-sheet sm-h-arrow"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="dg-node is-done sm-state sm-generated">
        <code class="sm-name">generated</code>
        <span class="dg-d">已寫回筆記</span>
        <span class="sm-loop"><span class="dg-who">你</span>要求「重新生成」：AI 覆寫元件，仍是 generated</span>
        <span class="sm-count">工作台：已生成</span>
      </div>

      <div class="sm-v sm-v-left">
        <div class="sm-vl"><div class="dg-down dg-sheet sm-line"></div><span class="dg-lab"><span class="dg-who is-ai">AI</span>修 3 次仍沒過</span></div>
        <div class="sm-vl"><div class="dg-up sm-line"></div><span class="dg-lab"><span class="dg-who">你</span>改了 prompt，改回 pending</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="sm-v sm-v-right">
        <div class="sm-vl"><div class="dg-down sm-line"></div><span class="dg-lab"><span class="dg-who">你</span>滿意或手調過，鎖起來</span></div>
        <div class="sm-vl"><div class="dg-up sm-line"></div><span class="dg-lab"><span class="dg-who">你</span>改回 generated 或 pending</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="dg-node is-blocked sm-state sm-failed">
        <code class="sm-name">failed</code>
        <span class="dg-d">筆記不引用元件；預設不重跑</span>
        <span class="sm-count">工作台：待生成</span>
      </div>
      <div class="dg-node sm-state sm-locked">
        <code class="sm-name">locked</code>
        <span class="dg-d">元件照常顯示；生成流程一律跳過</span>
        <span class="sm-count">工作台：待生成</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Diagram>

<style>
  .sm {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(140px, 0.7fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr);
    grid-template-areas:
      "entry . ."
      "pending h generated"
      "vl . vr"
      "failed . locked";
  }
  .sm-entry {
    grid-area: entry;
    min-height: 40px;
    --ax: 28px;
  }
  .sm-entry-lab {
    position: absolute;
    left: 42px;
    top: 50%;
    translate: 0 -50%;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .sm-pending {
    grid-area: pending;
  }
  .sm-generated {
    grid-area: generated;
  }
  .sm-failed {
    grid-area: failed;
  }
  .sm-locked {
    grid-area: locked;
  }
  .sm-state {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }
  .sm-name {
    font-size: 16px !important;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .sm-count {
    margin-top: 8px;
    padding-top: 6px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .is-blocked .sm-count {
    border-top-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mark-paper) 35%, transparent);
    color: var(--mark-paper);
  }
  .sm-loop {
    margin-top: 4px;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .sm-h {
    grid-area: h;
    align-self: center;
    padding: 0 10px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .sm-h-arrow {
    height: 12px;
    margin-top: 4px;
    --ay: 6px;
  }
  .sm-v {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
    min-height: 92px;
  }
  .sm-v-left {
    grid-area: vl;
  }
  .sm-v-right {
    grid-area: vr;
  }
  .sm-vl {
    flex: 1 1 0;
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .sm-line {
    flex: none;
    width: 12px;
    --ax: 6px;
  }
  .sm-vl .dg-lab {
    align-self: center;
    padding: 6px 0;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
</style>
